## Make plots

Run `SummaryPlots.py`:
 
```
python SummaryPlots.py <category> <year> [-i INDIR] [-o OUTDIR] [--plots ...] [--blind/--unblind]
```
 
- **category**: `VBFcat`, `ggHcat`, `VLcat`, `TTLcat`, `TTHcat`, `VHcat`, `Zinvcat`
- **year**: e.g. `2024`
- **-i/--indir**: snapshot dir (default `/work/submit/$USER/HmumuRun3/ROOTFILES/`)
- **-o/--outdir**: plot dir (default `/home/submit/$USER/HmumuRun3/output_plots/`)
- **--plots**: any of `mass mva category muons` (default: all)
- **--blind/--unblind**: blind data in the signal region (default: blinded)
 
Writes `<outdir>/<category>_<year>/<group>/Stack<var>_<category>_<year>.png`.
 
Examples:
```
python SummaryPlots.py ggHcat 2024                 # all plots, blinded
python SummaryPlots.py VLcat 2024 --plots mass muons
python SummaryPlots.py ggHcat 2024 --unblind       # use deliberately
```
